Subject: [PATCH] chore(claude): share the project's agents and skills; keep
 settings, worktrees and lock files local

- .gitignore: /.claude/* stays ignored except agents/ and skills/; lock
  files under .claude are ignored everywhere.
- .claude/agents: gate-runner, graph-updater, PR-reviewer.
- .claude/skills: review-prs.
- Machine-specific absolute paths replaced with repo-relative ones
  (`git rev-parse --show-toplevel`, "the main checkout").

